# Copié en `.dockerignore` à la racine marque avant `docker build`
# (CLI `creezio server-docker build` le pose si absent).

.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/dist-electron
**/dist-electron-server
**/ui
**/ui/node_modules
**/ui/.next
**/dumps
**/crm
**/src
**/data
**/docker-data
**/docker-data/**
**/*.AppImage
**/*.exe
**/*.blockmap
**/latest*.yml
**/.DS_Store
**/coverage
**/tmp
**/*.log
agent-transcripts
.cursor
docs
*.md
!README.md
